<li>&quot;No heat repair near me&quot;</li>
<li>&quot;Furnace not working&quot;</li>
<li>&quot;24 hour heating repair&quot;</li>
<li>&quot;Boiler repair emergency&quot;</li>
<li>&quot;Heating system failure&quot;</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Ad Copy Framework:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Headline 1: &quot;24/7 Emergency Heating Repair&quot;</li>
<li>Headline 2: &quot;No Heat? We Answer 24/7&quot;</li>
<li>Headline 3: &quot;Same-Day Service Guaranteed&quot;</li>
<li>Description: &quot;Furnace broken in the cold? Our techs are standing by with fully stocked trucks. Fast, honest repairs. Call now — we never close.&quot;</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Operational Requirements:</strong></p>
<p>Emergency PPC only works if your operations can deliver. Before scaling winter emergency ads, confirm:</p>
<ul>
<li>You have 24/7 phone answering (live or highly responsive answering service)</li>
<li>Technicians are available for after-hours calls</li>
<li>Trucks are stocked with common furnace parts (ignitors, flame sensors, blower motors, control boards)</li>
<li>Your dispatch system can route emergency calls efficiently</li>
