<p><strong>How to Execute:</strong></p>
<p>Heat pump conversion is the highest-ticket sale in residential HVAC. A complete system replacement ranges from <strong>$7,500-$12,500+</strong>, but the total addressable market is expanding rapidly. The key is education — most homeowners don&#39;t understand how heat pumps work, whether they work in cold climates, or how the financial incentives stack up.</p>
